                <head>No. 254.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Frelinghuysen to Mr. Lowell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 20,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Frelinghuysen instructed Mr. Lowell to immediately ascertain and report by
                    telegraph whether O’Donnell is an American citizen.</p>
            </div>
